WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.570
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.840 --> 01:43.990
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.310 --> 01:46.870
[Episode 11]

4
01:47.080 --> 01:52.940
[Emergency]

5
01:58.120 --> 01:58.920
It won't open again.

6
01:58.920 --> 02:00.580
Let's change this lock later.

7
02:02.150 --> 02:03.040
Do you have anything to eat?

8
02:03.040 --> 02:05.120
Snacks, staple food, or anything filling.

9
02:05.120 --> 02:05.790
What's wrong?

10
02:05.790 --> 02:06.560
There's nothing. What's up?

11
02:06.560 --> 02:07.280
Zhengliang just

12
02:07.280 --> 02:08.280
got a little dizzy when he stood up.

13
02:08.280 --> 02:09.810
Seems like low blood sugar.

14
02:10.360 --> 02:11.710
Then I'll go to the supermarket to buy him something.

15
02:11.710 --> 02:12.120
Wouldn't that solve it?

16
02:12.120 --> 02:12.430
Don't go.

17
02:12.430 --> 02:14.280
If you look for a bite to eat now,

18
02:14.280 --> 02:15.840
-well, it'll be too late. -Well, how about this?

19
02:15.840 --> 02:17.310
You take that apple.

20
02:17.310 --> 02:18.430
This won't work either.

21
02:18.430 --> 02:19.240
Well, he can also drink this.

22
02:19.240 --> 02:20.560
This drink.

23
02:20.560 --> 02:21.030
If it really doesn't work,

24
02:21.030 --> 02:22.120
give him some glucose!

25
02:22.120 --> 02:22.910
An IV drip!

26
02:22.910 --> 02:24.630
Okay, let him drink this first!

27
02:24.630 --> 02:25.750
Look at you.

28
02:25.750 --> 02:27.030
You won't do any tests

29
02:27.030 --> 02:28.150
or blood work.

30
02:28.150 --> 02:29.590
How am I supposed to treat you?

31
02:29.590 --> 02:31.000
If you insist on this,

32
02:31.000 --> 02:31.680
I can only prescribe

33
02:31.680 --> 02:33.240
a box of anti-diarrhea medicine for you.

34
02:33.240 --> 02:34.840
But you can't leave after taking it.

35
02:34.840 --> 02:35.710
You have to be monitored

36
02:35.710 --> 02:36.700
in the observation room for 2 hours.

37
02:36.700 --> 02:40.200
[Emergency Room]

38
02:37.910 --> 02:39.000
Honey.

39
02:39.800 --> 02:41.590
You'd better take me

40
02:41.590 --> 02:42.870
to No. 1 Hospital.

41
02:43.310 --> 02:44.360
It's just a bad stomach.

42
02:44.360 --> 02:45.680
You'll be fine once you get it all out.

43
02:45.680 --> 02:46.680
If you travel that far,

44
02:46.680 --> 02:47.590
can you even handle it?

45
02:47.590 --> 02:49.320
Besides, why spend that money?

46
02:49.400 --> 02:50.520
Get lost!

47
02:52.400 --> 02:54.280
I rummaged for a long time, and there's only half a bottle left.

48
02:54.280 --> 02:55.030
Drink it.

49
02:55.430 --> 02:56.680
What is this?

50
02:56.680 --> 02:57.400
Whose leftovers?

51
02:57.400 --> 02:58.470
You still mind drinking after me?

52
02:58.470 --> 02:59.430
If you're dizzy from hunger,

53
02:59.430 --> 03:01.430
I'll have to give you a glucose drip.

54
03:01.930 --> 03:02.710
Well,

55
03:03.520 --> 03:05.430
she says she has acute gastroenteritis,

56
03:05.430 --> 03:06.750
but she refuses to do any tests.

57
03:06.750 --> 03:07.400
I can only prescribe

58
03:07.400 --> 03:09.150
a box of anti-diarrhea medicine for her.

59
03:09.150 --> 03:09.960
After she takes it later,

60
03:09.960 --> 03:10.280
you take her

61
03:10.280 --> 03:11.560
to the observation room

62
03:11.560 --> 03:13.000
for monitoring for 2 hours.

63
03:13.000 --> 03:13.240
Okay.

64
03:13.240 --> 03:15.040
Then let Huang take a look at her.

65
03:16.120 --> 03:17.079
You go get the medicine.

66
03:17.079 --> 03:18.310
Let your wife go with him.

67
03:18.310 --> 03:19.560
Wait, after we get the medicine,

68
03:19.560 --> 03:21.360
can't we just go home and take it?

69
03:22.120 --> 03:23.190
Anyway, my advice is that

70
03:23.190 --> 03:25.000
you must stay for observation.

71
03:25.120 --> 03:26.680
If you insist on leaving, you can,

72
03:26.680 --> 03:27.710
but you have to sign.

73
03:27.710 --> 03:29.560
Honey, what are you doing?

74
03:29.840 --> 03:31.300
Just listen to the doctor.

75
03:31.400 --> 03:32.190
Okay, okay.

76
03:32.190 --> 03:32.870
Keep an eye out for me.

77
03:32.870 --> 03:33.590
I'll buy some food.

78
03:33.590 --> 03:34.720
Eat something warm.

79
03:34.910 --> 03:35.630
Look at you.

80
03:36.470 --> 03:37.710
Aren't you usually pretty tough?

81
03:37.710 --> 03:39.910
Come, the observation room is this way.

82
03:40.280 --> 03:41.079
Let's go.

83
03:41.190 --> 03:42.590
"Yearning"

84
03:43.590 --> 03:45.560
by Li Bai from the Tang Dynasty.

85
03:46.000 --> 03:49.030
Fresh autumn breeze, bright autumn moon.

86
03:49.560 --> 03:52.420
Fallen leaves gather and scatter around the trees;

87
03:52.630 --> 03:55.690
Cold-stricken crows soon fall asleep and wake as soon.

88
03:56.000 --> 03:58.960
I long for you. When can I see your longing look?

89
03:59.560 --> 04:03.400
How can I bear this lonely night, this lonely nook?

90
04:33.560 --> 04:40.860
[1314 Funeral Supplies] [Xiaoximen Store]

91
04:40.950 --> 04:47.970
[Pandora] [Starry Night]

92
04:50.390 --> 04:54.630
♪ Everyone on earth knows I love you ♪

93
04:54.390 --> 04:56.830
[Fucheng Xiaoximen Hospital]

94
04:56.970 --> 04:59.050
[Cures fast, heals well. Skilled, handsome, affordable.]

95
04:59.050 --> 05:03.180
[Liu Zhengliang, Star Chief Physician] [Emergency Department]

96
05:01.270 --> 05:03.000
You look pretty tough up close.

97
05:03.390 --> 05:04.310
Look at you.

98
05:04.310 --> 05:06.120
Your posture is quite stiff.

99
05:11.000 --> 05:12.530
You always pull a long face.

100
05:12.870 --> 05:14.270
You probably forgot how to smile.

101
05:14.270 --> 05:15.560
Look at those teeth.

102
05:19.190 --> 05:21.190
Look at how things worked out for us.

103
05:21.500 --> 05:29.250
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

104
05:21.560 --> 05:22.190
Isn't this

105
05:22.190 --> 05:25.120
Dr. Liu, who gets more handsome the more I look at him?

106
05:26.240 --> 05:28.040
What, pretending you can't hear me?

107
05:28.040 --> 05:28.830
Wait.

108
05:29.390 --> 05:30.310
Today,

109
05:30.310 --> 05:31.070
when you were at work,

110
05:31.070 --> 05:32.720
it wasn't convenient for you to answer my question.

111
05:32.720 --> 05:33.920
Can you answer it now?

112
05:35.510 --> 05:36.680
Please step aside.

113
05:36.680 --> 05:37.750
My blood sugar is low.

114
05:37.750 --> 05:39.070
I need to find some food.

115
05:39.070 --> 05:40.670
Then you need to eat quickly.

116
05:41.159 --> 05:42.490
I'll help you find some.

117
05:43.560 --> 05:45.000
Aren't they all closed?

118
05:45.680 --> 05:47.940
It's pitch black as far as the eye can see.

119
05:48.390 --> 05:49.850
But I have food at my place.

120
05:55.480 --> 05:57.540
Swallowing saliva won't fill you up.

121
05:58.190 --> 05:58.920
How about this?

122
05:58.920 --> 05:59.480
Either

123
05:59.480 --> 06:01.340
you come to my place for a hot meal,

124
06:01.480 --> 06:02.560
or you just stand here staring blankly,

125
06:02.560 --> 06:03.560
waiting to faint.

126
06:04.310 --> 06:05.710
Think about it yourself?

127
06:15.480 --> 06:16.870
How does it taste?

128
06:21.750 --> 06:22.560
A bit salty.

129
06:23.120 --> 06:23.920
But having it occasionally

130
06:23.920 --> 06:24.720
is fine.

131
06:25.750 --> 06:27.240
You're getting a free meal.

132
06:27.240 --> 06:28.900
And you're still being picky?

133
06:29.510 --> 06:30.970
Why don't you just starve?

134
06:39.630 --> 06:40.360
Thank you.

135
06:43.480 --> 06:45.880
What did you say? I didn't hear you clearly.

136
06:48.240 --> 06:49.970
What program are you watching?

137
06:52.270 --> 06:53.800
I usually like

138
06:53.800 --> 06:55.920
poetry and songs, these kind of stuff.

139
06:55.920 --> 06:56.830
Eat slowly.

140
06:58.240 --> 07:00.500
I like listening to people recite poetry

141
07:00.600 --> 07:01.800
to cultivate myself.

142
07:05.240 --> 07:06.750
Don't you dislike studying?

143
07:06.750 --> 07:08.240
Who dislikes studying?

144
07:08.830 --> 07:10.630
I love studying.

145
07:11.830 --> 07:12.510
Gosh.

146
07:12.510 --> 07:14.440
You even think I dislike studying.

147
07:14.630 --> 07:16.560
I just feel like throwing up when I read books.

148
07:16.560 --> 07:17.800
D-Did you

149
07:17.800 --> 07:19.460
listen to me carefully today?

150
07:22.680 --> 07:23.600
Understood.

151
07:25.040 --> 07:25.510
So you

152
07:25.510 --> 07:26.920
don't like reading yourself,

153
07:26.920 --> 07:28.920
but you like others reciting books.

154
07:31.270 --> 07:32.040
You're bad with words.

155
07:32.040 --> 07:33.240
Just hurry up and eat.

156
07:40.040 --> 07:40.600
Hello?

157
07:40.830 --> 07:43.310
Zhengliang, the patient is in shock.

158
07:44.070 --> 07:45.070
The one from just now,

159
07:45.070 --> 07:46.240
with acute gastroenteritis.

160
07:46.040 --> 07:46.270
[Emergency Department–Yellow Zone]

161
07:46.240 --> 07:46.600
Yes.

162
07:46.600 --> 07:47.659
Come back quickly.

163
07:50.510 --> 07:51.970
What's up, Mr. Fake Smile?

164
07:52.310 --> 07:53.310
Running away after eating?

165
07:52.890 --> 07:54.890
[1314 Funeral Supplies] [Xiaoximen Store]

166
08:27.870 --> 08:29.630
Mingming, what's the situation?

167
08:29.630 --> 08:30.650
Venous access has been established.

168
08:30.650 --> 08:31.770
Oxygen at 3 L/min.

169
08:32.080 --> 08:33.390
BP 70 over 40.

170
08:33.390 --> 08:34.650
Oxygen saturation 90.

171
08:34.720 --> 08:35.669
Heart rate 120.

172
08:37.850 --> 08:40.530
[Bed 2]

173
08:38.120 --> 08:39.200
IV fluids for pressure support.

174
08:39.200 --> 08:40.600
Normal saline 500 mL, wide open.

175
08:40.600 --> 08:41.799
Normal saline 500 mL.

176
08:41.870 --> 08:42.840
Start another IV line.

177
08:42.840 --> 08:44.600
Give 2 mg of norepinephrine.

178
08:44.600 --> 08:45.510
Draw blood immediately.

179
08:45.510 --> 08:47.630
Get ABG and routine labs.

180
08:50.790 --> 08:52.030
BP dropped again.

181
08:52.080 --> 08:53.340
Oxygen saturation 90.

182
08:53.550 --> 08:55.200
Titrate up the norepinephrine.

183
08:55.200 --> 08:56.120
Get the BVM ready.

184
08:56.120 --> 08:56.960
Ventilate.

185
08:57.670 --> 08:58.870
Call the anesthesiology department.

186
08:58.870 --> 09:01.070
Have them do endotracheal intubation.

187
09:09.600 --> 09:11.200
Ventricular fibrillation.

188
09:14.550 --> 09:16.550
Charge the defibrillator, quickly!

189
09:16.550 --> 09:17.750
360 joules.

190
09:17.750 --> 09:18.480
Ready.

191
09:30.360 --> 09:32.020
Prepare for defibrillation.

192
09:43.790 --> 09:44.850
Give epinephrine,

193
09:45.600 --> 09:46.750
1 mg IV push.

194
09:50.080 --> 09:50.870
Continue.

195
09:58.160 --> 09:59.480
[Build the Line of Defence of Life]

196
09:59.480 --> 10:07.300
[Fucheng Xiaoximen Hospital]

197
10:13.870 --> 10:18.420
[Outpatient Hall]

198
10:17.750 --> 10:19.410
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang!

199
10:19.440 --> 10:20.590
You killed my sis!

200
10:20.990 --> 10:22.990
Get out here and kowtow to apologize!

201
10:22.990 --> 10:23.750
The one leading the trouble

202
10:23.750 --> 10:25.280
is the deceased's brother.

203
10:25.520 --> 10:26.830
He's a contractor in Fucheng,

204
10:26.830 --> 10:28.040
and his business is quite big.

205
10:28.040 --> 10:28.800
So this matter

206
10:28.800 --> 10:29.950
won't be easily settled.

207
10:29.950 --> 10:31.560
They specifically asked for Liu Zhengliang.

208
10:31.560 --> 10:33.320
They insist he kowtows and kneels.

209
10:33.320 --> 10:35.520
After all, from treatment to death,

210
10:35.520 --> 10:36.320
it happened in less than an hour.

211
10:36.320 --> 10:37.630
She didn't have any tests done.

212
10:37.630 --> 10:38.680
As for the cause of death,

213
10:38.680 --> 10:40.320
Dr. Liu isn't clear about it either.

214
10:40.320 --> 10:41.280
Also,

215
10:41.400 --> 10:42.950
respect for the dead is paramount.

216
10:42.950 --> 10:43.990
In terms of public sympathy,

217
10:43.990 --> 10:45.520
he doesn't have the upper hand.

218
10:45.520 --> 10:46.750
Tell Liu Zhengliang to hold back.

219
10:46.750 --> 10:47.230
Don't show up.

220
10:47.230 --> 10:48.400
I'll hurry to the police station.

221
10:48.400 --> 10:49.560
Wait until I get back to do anything.

222
10:49.560 --> 10:49.870
Okay, got it.

223
10:49.870 --> 10:52.000
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

224
10:52.200 --> 10:54.560
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out! -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

225
10:54.560 --> 10:56.590
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

226
10:56.590 --> 10:58.870
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out! -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

227
10:58.870 --> 11:00.920
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

228
11:00.920 --> 11:03.280
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out! -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

229
11:03.280 --> 11:05.350
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

230
11:05.350 --> 11:07.590
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out! -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

231
11:07.590 --> 11:09.720
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

232
11:09.750 --> 11:12.470
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out! -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

233
11:12.470 --> 11:14.710
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

234
11:14.830 --> 11:17.200
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out! -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

235
11:17.200 --> 11:19.330
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

236
11:19.350 --> 11:21.470
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out! -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

237
11:21.470 --> 11:23.600
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, get out!

238
11:30.750 --> 11:31.990
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang,

239
11:31.990 --> 11:33.750
-kowtow and confess! -kowtow and confess!

240
11:33.750 --> 11:35.110
-Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, -Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang,

241
11:35.110 --> 11:36.470
-kowtow and confess! -kowtow and confess!

242
11:36.470 --> 11:39.080
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, kowtow and confess!

243
11:39.080 --> 11:41.880
Quack Doctor Liu Zhengliang, kowtow and confess!

244
11:41.950 --> 11:43.680
How long are you going to make a scene?

245
11:43.680 --> 11:45.740
Finally, someone comes out to speak.

246
11:46.080 --> 11:46.830
That guy named Liu Zhengliang,

247
11:46.830 --> 11:47.400
where is he hiding?

248
11:47.400 --> 11:48.530
Tell him to come out!

249
11:49.040 --> 11:50.110
He's off today.

250
11:50.110 --> 11:51.460
If you have anything to say, tell us.

251
11:51.460 --> 11:52.790
We'll pass it on for you.

252
11:52.800 --> 11:54.630
Then call him over from home.

253
11:54.680 --> 11:56.740
I won't leave until he shows up today.

254
11:57.630 --> 11:58.630
Here's the thing.

255
11:58.750 --> 11:59.800
Ms. Shao Nan

256
11:59.870 --> 12:01.670
refused to do all kinds of tests.

257
12:01.800 --> 12:03.080
We tried our best to persuade her,

258
12:03.080 --> 12:04.400
and she finally stayed for observation.

259
12:04.400 --> 12:06.110
As soon as she went into shock in the observation room,

260
12:06.110 --> 12:07.080
we immediately took

261
12:07.080 --> 12:08.280
emergency measures.

262
12:08.400 --> 12:09.680
From registration to the patient's death,

263
12:09.680 --> 12:10.990
it happened in less than an hour.

264
12:10.990 --> 12:11.710
Our emergency department

265
12:11.710 --> 12:13.040
has done everything we could.

266
12:13.040 --> 12:13.870
We wanted her to live

267
12:13.870 --> 12:15.130
more than anyone else.

268
12:15.520 --> 12:16.470
How can you be so sure

269
12:16.470 --> 12:16.830
that all of this

270
12:16.830 --> 12:18.110
is the doctor's fault?

271
12:18.110 --> 12:19.590
A perfectly fine person was sent here,

272
12:19.590 --> 12:20.320
and now she's gone!

273
12:20.320 --> 12:22.320
Who else should I blame if not the doctor?

274
12:22.320 --> 12:23.980
I can understand how you feel,

275
12:24.040 --> 12:25.100
and I'm very sorry.

276
12:25.400 --> 12:27.590
But doctors are not gods.

277
12:27.590 --> 12:28.590
The hospital can't cure

278
12:28.590 --> 12:29.470
every disease.

279
12:29.470 --> 12:30.160
If you can't cure diseases,

280
12:30.160 --> 12:31.400
how can you run a hospital?

281
12:31.400 --> 12:32.200
Little girl,

282
12:32.200 --> 12:32.870
is what you're saying

283
12:32.870 --> 12:34.110
even human?

284
12:34.400 --> 12:35.200
Let me ask you!

285
12:35.680 --> 12:36.400
Calm down, calm down, calm down!

286
12:36.400 --> 12:37.080
Don't push me!

287
12:37.080 --> 12:37.710
Don't push me!

288
12:37.710 --> 12:38.520
I'm not pushing you!

289
12:38.520 --> 12:39.950
We can talk things over!

290
12:39.990 --> 12:41.790
Who says we can talk things over?

291
12:41.870 --> 12:44.040
If you have any conditions, just say them.

292
12:44.040 --> 12:45.590
Our leaders can solve them.

293
12:46.520 --> 12:47.400
Conditions?

294
12:48.200 --> 12:49.560
Do you think I'm here to extort money?

295
12:49.560 --> 12:51.420
Do I look like I need your pennies?

296
12:52.400 --> 12:53.470
We can talk about conditions.

297
12:53.470 --> 12:54.710
I only have one condition.

298
12:54.710 --> 12:56.840
All the doctors in Xiaoximen Hospital

299
12:57.080 --> 12:59.160
must kneel in front of my sis's portrait today

300
12:59.160 --> 13:00.990
and kowtow to apologize!

301
13:01.320 --> 13:05.350
-Kowtow to apologize! Kowtow to apologize! -Kowtow to apologize! Kowtow to apologize!

302
13:05.350 --> 13:05.990
Shao.

303
13:06.630 --> 13:07.320
Bro.

304
13:08.080 --> 13:08.750
Your aunt and I

305
13:08.750 --> 13:10.480
were on the same modeling team.

306
13:10.830 --> 13:12.160
Calm down.

307
13:12.280 --> 13:13.200
She became a famous model

308
13:13.200 --> 13:14.730
all because of my teaching.

309
13:14.870 --> 13:16.470
Can you do me a favor?

310
13:16.470 --> 13:16.710
You...

311
13:16.710 --> 13:17.800
L-Let's find a place

312
13:17.800 --> 13:18.730
and talk nicely.

313
13:19.750 --> 13:21.200
So it's you, old man.

314
13:21.400 --> 13:22.160
You're the one

315
13:22.160 --> 13:23.320
who tricked my aunt every day

316
13:23.320 --> 13:25.230
into taking that useless traditional Chinese medicine.

317
13:25.230 --> 13:26.990
That medicine is good. That medicine...

318
13:26.990 --> 13:27.870
Get lost!

319
13:28.710 --> 13:30.520
Keep running your mouth, and you'll get it too!

320
13:30.520 --> 13:31.440
Why is this kid so unreasonable?

