Dance less in the future

984
40:04.990 --> 40:05.640
and put more energy

985
40:05.640 --> 40:06.950
into your work.

986
40:07.470 --> 40:08.270
Well...

987
40:08.390 --> 40:09.830
I think you're a good doctor,

988
40:09.830 --> 40:11.640
but your heart is in the wrong place.

989
40:11.640 --> 40:13.390
Chief Physician Tong, you're sick,

990
40:13.390 --> 40:14.520
but you have medicine.

991
40:14.520 --> 40:16.830
I wish you a speedy recovery from rhinitis.

992
40:16.830 --> 40:17.390
Come on.

993
40:18.200 --> 40:20.330
Three glasses, three glasses, I know.

994
40:30.790 --> 40:31.720
What should I do?

995
40:31.720 --> 40:33.310
-What is it? -What should I do?

996
40:33.310 --> 40:35.270
I really don't know what to say to you.

997
40:35.270 --> 40:36.720
You're too talkative.

998
40:36.720 --> 40:38.430
Are you hiding your true self from me?

999
40:38.430 --> 40:39.830
Why are you so talkative?

1000
40:40.430 --> 40:41.600
Are you happy today?

1001
40:41.600 --> 40:42.830
I'm very happy.

1002
40:43.240 --> 40:45.560
Let me tell you from the bottom of my heart,

1003
40:45.560 --> 40:47.560
I wish I could be as talkative as you.

1004
40:47.720 --> 40:48.520
Really.

1005
40:49.350 --> 40:50.270
You've gone a full circle.

1006
40:50.270 --> 40:51.470
You can really drink.

1007
40:51.870 --> 40:53.130
Don't keep hitting me.

1008
40:53.270 --> 40:54.470
Don't keep hitting me.

1009
40:54.470 --> 40:56.070
You hit me at the drop of a hat.

1010
40:56.200 --> 40:58.060
You treat me like Liu Zhengguang?

1011
40:58.120 --> 41:00.120
Then I'll just say 3 words, okay?

1012
41:00.240 --> 41:01.350
I like you.

1013
41:01.910 --> 41:02.760
I'll down it.

1014
41:05.470 --> 41:06.350
Say no more.

1015
41:06.350 --> 41:08.200
It's all in the wine.

1016
41:09.200 --> 41:10.330
Say a few more words.

1017
41:11.680 --> 41:12.740
I, Liu Zhengliang,

1018
41:13.240 --> 41:15.100
left my hometown when I was young.

1019
41:16.160 --> 41:17.200
Every day I'm away,

1020
41:17.200 --> 41:18.600
I miss my hometown.

1021
41:18.600 --> 41:19.520
I miss my mom.

1022
41:20.430 --> 41:21.240
Finally,

1023
41:23.160 --> 41:24.430
I love Fucheng!

1024
41:25.080 --> 41:26.610
I love Xiaoximen Hospital!

1025
41:29.230 --> 41:30.160
-Great! -Great!

1026
41:30.160 --> 41:31.160
Well said, Zhengliang!

1027
41:31.160 --> 41:31.760
-Great! -Great!

1028
41:31.760 --> 41:32.640
Awesome!

1029
41:33.040 --> 41:34.240
Thank you, everyone!

1030
41:34.520 --> 41:36.160
Thank you, everyone!

1031
41:37.080 --> 41:38.470
Thank you!

1032
42:09.790 --> 42:10.600
You're awake.

1033
42:12.160 --> 42:14.490
If it weren't for this room full of doctors

1034
42:14.640 --> 42:16.430
saying you didn't need to go to the hospital,

1035
42:16.430 --> 42:18.560
I would have carried you there myself.

1036
42:18.950 --> 42:21.160
You really pass out after one drink.

1037
42:22.160 --> 42:23.820
I made you some hangover soup.

1038
42:24.240 --> 42:25.370
It's sour and spicy.

1039
42:26.600 --> 42:28.460
It's been keeping warm in the pot.

1040
42:37.950 --> 42:38.430
Come on,

1041
42:39.350 --> 42:39.990
drink it.

1042
42:45.990 --> 42:46.790
What's wrong?

1043
42:46.910 --> 42:48.350
I-It's too hot.

1044
42:51.990 --> 42:53.790
Come on, don't dawdle.

1045
42:54.310 --> 42:55.790
You have to drink this in one gulp.

1046
42:55.790 --> 42:57.240
Didn't I tell you it's for hangovers?

1047
42:57.240 --> 42:57.910
Hurry up.

1048
42:58.470 --> 42:59.270
Hurry up.

1049
43:08.430 --> 43:08.830
Okay.
